{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"RP-02/RP-03 epic decomposition and plan-review completion (2026-08-17, code basis origin/main 034e17209c9b30dad3aa08971a10b71f39fd5547).\n\nCross-epic dependency:\n- RP-03 unfearful-dejected-verdin (4217-d1d6-370b-4e98) depends_on RP-02 citric-moudly-vipersquid (5e64-d9cd-2dd4-4036).\n\nRP-02 graph:\n- S1 mica-governing-buck (5142-4dbf-9469-4672).\n  - vivacious-widish-indianabat (2c81-7119-fb6b-44b1) -> evadable-curious-mastodon (34f2-8d32-029c-400b) -> patterned-fossillike-betafish (0eb8-08bd-f9cb-4798).\n- S2 brainy-cooked-hog (fc1c-1b08-70c2-4afb) depends_on S1.\n  - dermatoid-brassy-junco (6083-b802-e90a-416e) -> sportive-statued-goose (f59b-56c1-596d-422a) -> morose-selfaware-unicorn (2419-2804-c181-4bc0).\n- S3 convergent-pinelike-lunamoth (486a-69ef-6370-48ff) depends_on S1 and S2.\n  - polarized-servile-jenny (c4f7-82ff-1004-4da5) -> flamboyant-possessive-blackbuck (90a5-6a33-5cda-4064) -> likeminded-wearproof-barracuda (ef69-e27b-d02d-4eef).\n\nRP-03 graph:\n- S1 stable-foggy-hammerkop (f5ac-6373-5e33-4374).\n  - heavensent-nonproift-galago (7bc2-5203-d5f4-4a4a) -> Cloud grouchy-benighted-fowl (a8cd-01cd-c370-454f) and DC sedentary-assiduous-loon (c6f3-cda5-c460-4c5c) in parallel -> astatine-physical-toadfish (72d0-0f09-1694-4010), which explicitly depends on all three.\n- S2 unrational-undefiled-shoveler (f828-6f5e-3b15-41f5) depends_on S1.\n  - ill-acardiac-caiman (0ad4-9f1c-09f6-4760) -> uncanny-silvery-hawk (85f8-de1a-e425-4584) -> herculean-minuscular-noctilio (7bd6-3aa1-dbeb-42c5).\n- S3 slowmoving-engaging-kouprey (28a3-a62d-6345-44a0) depends_on S2.\n  - covert-nickel-yearling (d0ec-da23-32ba-47c6) -> sarcastic-rusted-akitainu (dd65-54fa-f4c3-4bc9) -> mechanical-grabbable-wolverine (67d4-ecba-cf95-4353).\n- S4 vegan-defaceable-moth (59b0-d1b9-ad94-4339) depends_on S3.\n  - colloquial-key-groundhog (d04c-c184-0b00-4a8a) -> dimming-grandiose-swift (1cb3-d60c-0d32-4cfe) -> silly-mystical-annelid (2863-c335-4567-4430).\n- S5 diamond-flavoured-esok (3350-90b1-2651-4c50) depends_on S1 and S4.\n  - brinish-unlit-bagworm (b81b-8671-3c61-488f) and postmodern-tangled-mollusk (0f5d-2a24-91d2-4148) in parallel -> fidgety-dead-vipersquid (a735-052e-8eca-4aeb).\n\nCertified/current:\n- RP-02 epic citric-moudly-vipersquid: PASS at 034e17209c.\n- RP-02 S1 mica-governing-buck and unblocked leaf vivacious-widish-indianabat: certified at 548e4d2997 and current by file-impact currency.\n- RP-03 S1 contract leaf heavensent-nonproift-galago and S1 stable-foggy-hammerkop: PASS at 034e17209c.\n\nPlan-review remediation completed:\n- Exact operation/log/per-mutation diagnostic cardinality and Unicode bounds.\n- Cloud/DC-specific test ownership; T4 direct dependency on T1.\n- ADR 0100 rollback and deltas from ADRs 0084/0087/0004/0026/0029.\n- Jira 3.10.5 max_retries constructor/source/no-network read-back evidence and issue-789 applicability note on the DC child.\n- T4 now exactly mirrors the parent one-message/512-code-point handler contract.\n\nBlocked/unsigned by design:\n- RP-03 epic unfearful-dejected-verdin is unsigned because RP-02 remains open and blocks it; no --force review was used.\n- Descendants after each first leaf remain blocked until dependencies close. next-batch returns only vivacious-widish-indianabat for RP-02 and heavensent-nonproift-galago for RP-03; both are already certified.\n- No blocked ticket was force-reviewed or claimed."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1787034258037904001,"uuid":"72c64664-e6d4-4860-ac4a-8bccb64d0d26"}